    {
      "id": "claim_d8de3ebadeb74c8f87c52daecb68441c",
      "statement": "The package is Node-only by design: the admin node's originVetoer rejects browser-origin requests. It is not a framework adapter — there is no reactive state, no session to restore, no signal to update.",
